 A soft, plucked Guzheng enters with descending pentatonic arpeggios, establishing a nostalgic mood.\n- Verse 1 (0:12 - 0:34): The Guzheng provides a sparse, rhythmic accompaniment alongside a warm acoustic bass. A subtle Erhu countermelody weaves in and out of the vocals, maintaining a minimalist, intimate texture.\n- Chorus (0:34 - 0:58): The arrangement swells as a lush string section enters, supported by a soft, brushed snare drum and a deep sub-bass. The Guzheng plays rapid tremolos (Yaozhi) while the Dizi soars above, mirroring the vocal melody with high emotional intensity.\n- Verse 2 (0:58 - 1:18): The percussion drops out, leaving a delicate duet between the vocals and a muted acoustic guitar, interspersed with occasional, resonant Guzheng plucks to maintain the Jiangnan rain aesthetic.\n- Outro (1:18 - 1:30): The instrumentation fades to a single, fading Guzheng chord and a final, breathy phrase from the Dizi. The sound of rain gently returns to the foreground, slowly washing away into silence."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 95, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 73, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "title": "描述预览", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [562.6991577148438, 823.671142578125], "pos": [1183.73486328125, 16.5322265625], "widgets_values": ["[Intro]\n（古筝轻拨，细雨声渐入）\n啊~ \n\n[Verse 1]\n江南雨 细细碎碎落成线\n打湿了 檐下红药和青砖\n我撑伞 站在长街的转角\n等一个 归期未定的誓言\n\n[Chorus]\n烟雨遥 遥不过一笔相思\n风声悄 悄吹散红豆几颗\n你在天涯 留白了故事\n我守着旧梦 湿了青丝\n\n[Verse 2]\n乌篷船 摇碎了水中明月\n石拱桥 刻下当年的离别\n墨色染 宣纸上你的眉眼\n这一生 执笔只为你画线\n\n[Outro]\n呜~ 笛声渐远\n雨未歇 人未归\n（雨声渐歇，古筝余音）\n[Fade Out]"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 94, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 72, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "title": "歌词预览", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"},